@host = http://localhost:5045

###
POST {{host}}/api/troops
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shortName": "1 KDH",
  "fullName": "1 Krakowska Drużyna Harcerzy"
}
###
POST {{host}}/api/troops
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shortName": "",
  "fullName": null
}
###
GET {{host}}/api/troops

###
GET {{host}}/api/troops/1

### poprawny plan
POST {{host}}/api/workplans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Zimowisko 2027",
  "tripType": "WinterCamp",
  "startDate": "2027-01-20",
  "endDate": "2027-01-27",
  "location": "Bieszczady",
  "troopId": 1
}

### nieistniejąca drużyna → 400
POST {{host}}/api/workplans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "tripType": "WinterCamp",
  "startDate": "2027-01-20",
  "endDate": "2027-01-27",
  "troopId": 999
}

### odwrócone daty → 400
POST {{host}}/api/workplans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "tripType": "WinterCamp",
  "startDate": "2027-01-27",
  "endDate": "2027-01-20",
  "troopId": 1
}

### lista planów
GET {{host}}/api/workplans

### dodaj cel do planu 1
POST {{host}}/api/workplans/1/goals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Harcerze potrafią rozpalić ognisko jedną zapałką",
  "category": "Scouting",
  "description": "Zajęcia terenowe w zastępach"
}

### cel bez kategorii → 400
POST {{host}}/api/workplans/1/goals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test"
}

### cel do nieistniejącego planu → 404
POST {{host}}/api/workplans/999/goals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "category": "Methodological"
}

### cele planu 1
GET {{host}}/api/workplans/1/goals

### cel 1 z planu 1
GET {{host}}/api/workplans/1/goals/1